00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:27.560
It's going to have the same result. 
Nothing. 

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:35.380
By the way, there's no author listed 
for that Mahamudra text in the tengyur.

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:42.080
@GSANG SNGAGS KYI MYUR KHYAD KYANG SEMS 'DI LHAG TU BTANG BA LAS 'BYUNG BA YIN

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:45.022
He makes a very radical statement.

00:21:45.022 --> 00:21:56.100
The secret way, diamond way, tantra practice, 
is supposed to get you enlightened in one lifetime 
as opposed to billions of years.

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:02.000
And he says what makes it faster is bodhichitta.

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:05.780
What makes tantra faster 
is the attitude that you do it with.

00:22:05.780 --> 00:22:13.180
The thing that makes Tantra go faster, 
is wanting to do it for other people.

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:16.583
Then he quotes some famous Lamas.

00:22:16.583 --> 00:22:18.461
LCANG SKYA ROL RDOR GYIS,

00:22:18.461 --> 00:22:21.840
PHUR LCOG NGAG DBANG 
BYAMS PA LA CHOS GSAN TE

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:28.020
Changkya Rolpe Dorje, his name here is abbreviated,

00:22:28.020 --> 00:22:34.120
is a very, very famous scholar of Buddhism.

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:46.160
He is famous for a four volume study 
of all the schools of buddhism. And other schools.

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:49.120
He had a teacher named 
@ PHUR LCOG NGAG DBANG BYAMS PA

00:22:49.540 --> 00:22:51.700
who is a very, very famous logician,

00:22:52.060 --> 00:22:55.380
and we use his books in our geshe program.

00:22:56.500 --> 00:23:03.540
@ LA CHOS GSAN TE
They lived in the 1700's, the early part of the 1700's.

00:23:04.700 --> 00:23:14.480
Changkya Rolpay Dorje used to 
go to Purchok Ngawang Jampa for classes.

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:23.500
These Lamas had a connection with teaching the chinese emperor in Beijing.

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:29.480
There is still a temple there, where they would teach the chinese emperor.

00:23:30.080 --> 00:23:43.300
Secretly, Pabongka Rinpoche was 
a reincarnation of these Lamas.

00:23:43.300 --> 00:23:46.740
It's very interesting. Of Changkya. 

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:53.560
He was a reincarnation of the lama 
who taught the kings of China.

00:23:53.560 --> 00:23:58.960
But there was a lot of political problems
at that time, in his lifetime.

00:24:00.880 --> 00:24:08.200
So they made an announcement that he was an incarnation of the Pabongka line, which he was not.

00:24:08.640 --> 00:24:16.940
He was an incarnation of the Changkya line, 
but they didn't want to m,ake it public. 
So he was misnamed his whole life.

00:24:18.300 --> 00:24:22.560
But it's interesting that he quotes himself,
is what I'm saying.

00:24:23.840 --> 00:24:29.829
@LA CHOS GSAN TE, BLA MA BYAMS PAS DBANG CHEN GNANG BA NA'ANG

00:24:29.960 --> 00:24:36.720
Now he says, Changkya says, 
when I go to my teacher and he starts teaching tantra

00:24:36.720 --> 00:24:40.180
and he decides to teach an initiation--

00:24:41.420 --> 00:24:49.040
In the next Lam Rim retreat, which was supposed to be at Diamond Mountain in October,

00:24:49.400 --> 00:24:54.120
I'd like to repeat that we're going to be doing 
a Medicine Buddha initiation.

00:24:54.400 --> 00:24:55.960
Online.

00:24:56.180 --> 00:24:58.360
With permission of medicine Buddha.

00:25:00.400 --> 00:25:05.840
We're going to have teachings on Medicine Buddha with a famous Chinese master,

00:25:06.220 --> 00:25:08.220
a good friend of mine.

00:25:08.520 --> 00:25:10.760
So you're welcome to come to that.

00:25:10.760 --> 00:25:17.120
Now Changkya is complaining. 
He says, I go to him for one of these high 
Medicine Buddha initiations,

00:25:17.960 --> 00:25:26.220
and @ DBANG BSHAD DU
 when it gets time for him to explain the tantra to us, he goes off on lam rim!

00:25:26.220 --> 00:25:29.380
You can feel Changkya is a little bit frustrated.

00:25:29.380 --> 00:25:38.100
We're supposed to get this very mysterious tantric teaching and Purchok Rinpoche, 
he just goes off on Lam Rim.

00:25:38.440 --> 00:25:42.880
We're all waiting for the secret stuff 
