00:25:43.220 --> 00:25:49.760
@ LAM RIM SHA STAG. 
@SHA STAG means he just teaches lam rim, 
nothing else.

00:25:49.760 --> 00:25:54.400
@SHA STAG GNANG BA LA, 
GZHAN GYIS BLTAS NA GSANG SNGAGS 
