that this guy is giving a tantric initiation.

00:26:04.520 --> 00:26:08.960
If a stranger came in the room, I don't know, 
to deliver the refreshments,

00:26:09.860 --> 00:26:17.780
and he went back to the kitchen and they said, 
"what's that guy teaching in there?" 
He says, "he is just doing the lam rim".

00:26:17.860 --> 00:26:21.940
There is nothing tantric about it all.

00:26:22.240 --> 00:26:25.380
@GSANG SNGAGS KYI GSUNG BSHAD BYED RGYU MED PA LTAR SNANG MOD

00:26:25.860 --> 00:26:27.600
but,
@MOD means but

00:26:28.200 --> 00:26:32.180
@KHONG GI DE LAM GYI GNAD 
MKHYEN PA'I GSUNG YIN

00:26:32.180 --> 00:26:42.720
But Changkya later said, "it finally occurred to me, that when he's teaching bodhichitta from the lam rim

00:26:42.940 --> 00:26:48.800
instead of explaining the tantric initiation to us, 
that's the real initiation"

00:26:48.820 --> 00:26:53.220
So that's cool. That's amazing.

00:26:53.220 --> 00:26:58.480
 @BSNGAGS PA MDZAD 
And he praised his Lama for doing that.

